### 场景1：游戏排行榜

### 1.1 新增玩家排行榜信息
POST http://localhost:10001/sortedSet/addPlayers
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "playerId": 1,
    "playerScore": "2500",
    "playerScoreTime": "2025-01-15 10:00:00"
  },
  {
    "playerId": 2,
    "playerScore": "500",
    "playerScoreTime": "2025-01-15 10:00:11"
  },
  {
    "playerId": 3,
    "playerScore": "500",
    "playerScoreTime": "2025-01-15 10:00:00"
  },
  {
    "playerId": 4,
    "playerScore": "987770",
