  }
]

### 1.2 获取Top3玩家排行榜信息
GET http://localhost:10001/sortedSet/getTop3Player
Accept: application/json

### 1.3 获取指定玩家排名
GET http://localhost:10001/sortedSet/getPlayerRank/2
Accept: application/json